l1: $ (⟦ x / t ⟧ (ap (ap A B) C)) ≐ ap (ap (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B)) (⟦ x / t ⟧ C) $ by ceqt_refl

da_eq
-----
