n15: $ G , a = kc_srt , a ∊ ω , b = scons T ∅ , b ∊ fseq (trees ω) ⇒ ap (fv (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_srt , scons T ∅ ⟩) w = ap (clam i lvals (clam j (fseq u) (fv uni (lv (fv b ∅) i)))) w $ by ap_eq [n12, n15a]
