l20: $ G , z ∊ dnb u M K S V ⇒ (K = kc_pi ∧ z ∊ clam x0 lvals (clam x1 (fseq u) (cpi x2 (da (fv V ∅) x0 x1) (da (fv V (suc ∅)) x0 (scons x2 x1))))) ∨ (K = kc_proj ∧ z ∊ clam x0 lvals (clam x1 (fseq u) (fv (da (fv V (suc (suc ∅))) x0 x1) (suc (fv nvf (fv S (suc ∅))))))) ∨ (K ∈ kexa ∧ z ∊ clam x0 lvals (clam x1 (fseq u) (mclip u (ap (fv M ⟨ u , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , V ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) x0)))) ∨ (¬ K ∈ kstr ∧ z ∊ sclip (fv M ⟨ u , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , V ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)) $ by m4_ds_l [l10, l19]
