l23: $ G , z ∊ dnb u M K S V ⇒ K ∈ kexa ∧ z ∊ clam x0 lvals (clam x1 (fseq u) (mclip u (ap (fv M ⟨ u , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , V ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) x0))) $ by m4_ds_r [l16, l22]
