l40: $ G , k = kc_pi , k ∊ ω , h = scons T (scons T2 ∅) , h ∊ fseq (trees ω) ⇒ ap (fv (ccom (dnf u M) h) ∅) w = ap (fv (dnf u M) T) w $ by ap_eq [l35, l21]
