l49: $ G , k = kc_pi , k ∊ ω , h = scons T (scons T2 ∅) , h ∊ fseq (trees ω) ⇒ ap (ap (fv (dnf u M) ⟨ k , h ⟩) w) r = cpi x (dt u M T w r) (dt u M T2 w (scons x r)) $ by eq_trans [l28, l48]
