l17: $ G , k = K , k ∊ ω , h = S , h ∊ fseq (trees ω) ⇒ ap (fv (dnf u M) ⟨ k , h ⟩) w = clam x1 (fseq u) (mclip u (ap (fv M ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , (ccom (dnf u M) h) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) w)) $ by eq_trans [l15, l16]
