lemma m5_all {a q: set} (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w: set):
  $ G ⇒ uadm u $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ {a | a ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr → ∀ q (q ∊ fseq u → dt u M a w q ∈ u)} $
----
l1: $ G , o = ω , k ∊ o , j ∊ fseq (trees o) , crn j ⊆ {a | a ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr → ∀ q (q ∊ fseq u → dt u M a w q ∈ u)} , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , v ∊ fseq u ⇒ uadm u $ by weaken [#1]
